# Frontend

## Styling

- Use semantic Tailwind utilities (`bg-canvas`, `text-fg`, `border-border`, etc.) generated via `@theme inline` in `app/globals.css`.
- Never use raw hex values, `--p-*` primitive vars, or Tailwind color palette classes (e.g. `bg-blue-500`) in components.
- Compose class names with `cn()` from `@/lib/cn` (clsx + tailwind-merge).
- Use density tokens for control heights and spacing: `h-[var(--control-height)]`, `var(--space-*)`, `var(--page-padding-x)`.

## Components

- Primitives → `components/ui/`; app-specific composed components → `components/custom/`.
- Follow the `ComponentName/` folder structure defined in `architecture.mdc`.
- Declare variants as `Record<VariantName, string>` and merge with `cn(BASE, VARIANT_CLASSES[variant], className)`.
- Export the component and its public types through `index.ts`.
- Server Component by default; add `"use client"` only for interactivity.

## Icons

Use `react-icons` (package `react-icons`). Prefer the `ri` (Remix Icons) set for consistency.

## Forms

- Build forms with `react-hook-form` and `zodResolver` from `@hookform/resolvers/zod`.
- Define schemas in `lib/validations/` using `zod`.
- Reusable input primitives live in `components/ui/`; form compositions live in `components/custom/`.

## Animation

- Use `motion` (the `motion` package, not framer-motion) only for meaningful transitions.
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`; gate animations behind the media query or Motion's `useReducedMotion`.

## Dates in UI

Import date helpers from `@/lib/date-time`. See `date-time.mdc` for the full convention.
